Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Dance! Dance! Drink! Enjoy!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.98,0:00:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be shy now!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.26,0:00:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,No flesh to weigh me down.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.48,0:00:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, not that I had any to begin with.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.98,0:00:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Skeleton choke.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.02,0:00:57.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd call myself vain,\Nbut I ain't got them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.88,0:00:59.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever, time to search.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.92,0:01:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,This door smells fishy, or rather it would\Nif I had enough. Yes, three in a row.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.20,0:01:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's peculiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.22,0:01:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What are these dolls?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.26,0:01:35.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.18,0:01:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.94,0:01:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,A polygraph?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.52,0:01:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,One dream, one wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.74,0:01:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want it, gotta go over the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.38,0:02:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Set and sail and heading for the unknown.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.16,0:02:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Cutting through the\Nwinds and waves as I go
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.04,0:02:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta keep it up, never stopping, no\NCause I'm aiming to get there first,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.60,0:02:25.04,Default,,0,0,0,,yeah It's all or nothing, no time to worry\NDo it later, right now I'm living free
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.28,0:02:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,When your foes look like\Nthey will overwhelm you It
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.22,0:02:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Means your heart's saying\Nthis is what you can't do.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.12,0:02:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Despite all that to run is\Nnot an option Once they're
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.22,0:02:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,close to feel the satisfaction\NYou think I'm rude,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.72,0:02:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,here's my appreciation When things\Nare getting tough, just gotta smile
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.72,0:02:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,If you are going on your way\NAnd you're looking for a fresh,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.60,0:02:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,brand new day Then make sure your\Nonly thought you have is Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.18,0:03:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I can
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.76,0:03:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,As you're on your way Marked\Nmaps will be made Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.10,0:03:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,with every step that you will take
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.80,0:03:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Just look at all you've been through\NLook ahead on new horizons In view,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.68,0:03:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,shining brightly Oh, who\Nknows what's waiting for you
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.88,0:03:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Dream living, that's the way.\NMake like a hurricane now,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.24,0:03:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,got to make your mark today
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.56,0:03:30.24,Default,,0,0,0,,One dream,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.32,0:03:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,one wish Your dreams don't run away
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.92,0:03:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Go for the knockout Over the top
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.90,0:03:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.84,0:03:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We've lost connection!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.98,0:03:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Switch to another camera then! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.92,0:04:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.84,0:04:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.10,0:04:15.51,Default,,0,0,0,,They made it past our fight on the\Nfence, but I'm heading up the falls now!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.20,0:04:23.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.42,0:04:26.89,Default,,0,0,0,,How are these fish climbing the waterfall?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.40,0:04:28.92,Default,,0,0,0,,That's lickety-slick.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.70,0:04:30.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.14,0:04:31.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Morons!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.05,0:04:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you even doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.62,0:04:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let that hag set\Nfoot on the island. Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.88,0:04:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We have no protection set up once\Nthey clear the water, though, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.22,0:04:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,And to be fair, we're dealing\Nwith some very strong enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.42,0:04:47.95,Default,,0,0,0,,We need a lot more time to set up weapons\Nto take down guys of their caliber.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.04,0:04:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop panicking.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.28,0:04:53.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.26,0:04:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Lin-Lin can go to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.32,0:05:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,And she can take her family\Nwith her at that, dammit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.02,0:05:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You all need to get your shit together.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.94,0:05:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, prepare for an Alto war!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.74,0:05:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's not be complacent, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.70,0:05:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,One ship, their\Nincompetence is astounding.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.72,0:06:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll end this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.18,0:06:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We're nearing the top!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.80,0:06:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like we'll make it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.90,0:06:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, kind of!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.72,0:06:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.80,0:06:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Something's approaching!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.74,0:06:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I see that! Is it King?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.46,0:06:29.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Deronatan!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.37,0:06:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Open fire off!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.42,0:06:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Lickety-splitting already?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.96,0:07:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma-ma-ma-ma!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.58,0:07:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha-ha-ha-ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.42,0:07:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We're almost to the land of Wano!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.42,0:07:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Your time is up, Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.42,0:07:15.01,Default,,0,0,0,,She's coming back for more!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.42,0:07:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,This might get ugly!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.42,0:07:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.40,0:07:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You little bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.60,0:07:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let you enter our country.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.38,0:08:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Enjoy your watery grave, hag.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.88,0:08:25.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you're keeping up!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.96,0:08:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm trying, but why are we\Nrunning away in the first place?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.88,0:08:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,They're after Sangoro, not us two!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.84,0:08:37.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you already forget that you knocked\Nout one of those Kyoshiro clowns too?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.14,0:08:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,They're going to be looking for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.98,0:08:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my bad. Oopsie.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.90,0:08:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, we can't afford to\Nmake Orochi angry right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.86,0:08:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The Tobiropo are the big\Ndogs and the beast pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.70,0:08:54.47,Default,,0,0,0,,So we messed up bad if\Nthey sent them after us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.86,0:08:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,An enemy! Time to bail!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.80,0:09:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.06,0:09:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't scare me like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.26,0:09:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not safe here. Follow me. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.84,0:09:13.55,Default,,0,0,0,,We're in some deep crap here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.78,0:09:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no use in pointing fingers.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.76,0:09:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We can still salvage the mission,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.60,0:09:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,but the element of surprise is the\Nonly thing that's keeping us alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.82,0:09:25.53,Default,,0,0,0,,If they find out who we are, your\Nwhole crew's as good as dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.72,0:09:26.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.63,0:09:28.43,Default,,0,0,0,,That means Nami and Robin are in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.02,0:09:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Make this one promise to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.46,0:09:36.75,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're captured, don't say a word\Nabout the Kozuki Clan's involvement.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.86,0:09:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,20 years of vengeance is on the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.62,0:09:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to swear to me, even\Nif they detain and torture you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.36,0:09:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't mention the samurai\Nor the minks. You got that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.30,0:09:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep your mouth shut\Nand let them kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.14,0:09:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Loopy would never say something\Nlike that. I'm not him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.50,0:10:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,So if we hide our faces,\Ncan we still throw down?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.68,0:10:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, check this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.74,0:10:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just an anonymous ass-kicker now!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.86,0:10:17.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We should avoid all confrontation.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.98,0:10:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't remember voting\Nyou in as our captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.48,0:10:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You better hope I'm not caught.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.20,0:10:24.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause I'll spill\Neverything to save myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.86,0:10:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Not on my watch, you won't!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.48,0:10:28.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna protect you so hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.32,0:10:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It worked!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.88,0:10:30.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.50,0:10:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,A lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.22,0:10:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What caused that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.02,0:10:56.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It must be the enemy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.26,0:11:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We have nothing to do with this!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.74,0:11:22.33,Default,,0,0,0,,That's our family business!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.54,0:11:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We're unaffiliated with the\Nman you're in search of!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.36,0:11:27.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You just destroyed our livelihood!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.56,0:11:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,With that, it will be\Nkicked out of the capital!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.06,0:11:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to hold it against someone?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.12,0:11:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Then blame it on Sangoro.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.62,0:11:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are the other soba shops?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.40,0:11:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll destroy every last\None until I find them!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.70,0:11:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring me the fool who dared to\Nmess with the Kyoshiro clan!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.78,0:11:55.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm brewing your patience.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.30,0:11:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I might just have to eat you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.92,0:12:03.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Sangoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.74,0:12:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Sangoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.60,0:12:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Sangoro! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.18,0:12:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, come out!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.48,0:12:21.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Sangoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.08,0:12:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Show yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.28,0:12:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What a shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.02,0:12:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems like he's too\Nmuch of a coward to man up
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.20,0:12:38.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm in the mood for dessert now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.16,0:12:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,They want to lure you out Ignore them\NOur only priority is getting out safe
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.70,0:12:47.53,Default,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.12,0:12:50.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to help them
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.18,0:12:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, Sanchi, come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.78,0:12:58.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.84,0:13:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We have nothing to do with Batman!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.92,0:13:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Then find him for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.06,0:13:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring me Sandoron, the soba cook!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.54,0:13:18.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Looking for me? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.24,0:13:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm right here!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.16,0:13:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Diablo, Jabra!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.92,0:13:25.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Konkisei!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.62,0:13:42.56,Default,,0,0,0,,He came out!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.08,0:13:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the guy, Scar\Nwith the special soba!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.52,0:13:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,So there you are. I've\Nbeen looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.88,0:14:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,what took you so long page one reporting
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.76,0:14:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,in found the target\Nsixth block district two
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.92,0:14:09.39,Default,,0,0,0,,right roger that we'll send in some backup
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.46,0:14:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Hehehehe. Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.18,0:14:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You prepared to meet your end?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.00,0:14:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You got dinosaur powers, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.12,0:14:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You asshole!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.32,0:14:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Sangoro! Come on! Time to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.36,0:14:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,If Drake and Hawkins show\Nup, then everything is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.76,0:14:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.18,0:14:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,But luckily this bastard doesn't\Nknow who I am. I won't get injured.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.06,0:14:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,and i'll stay undercover i just\Nhave to beat him in an instant right
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.96,0:15:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,recruiting allies is important of course
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.98,0:15:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,But having fewer enemies\Nis good too, you're
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.56,0:15:13.03,Default,,0,0,0,,gonna back up those big words you're using
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.32,0:15:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,guys go on without me
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.12,0:15:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise they won't find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.70,0:15:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,My identity will remain a secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.52,0:15:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That cook guy really came out of hiding?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.88,0:15:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.06,0:15:48.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Does he have a death wish?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.22,0:15:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, what do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.62,0:15:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I found a use for this thing. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.16,0:15:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.74,0:15:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,A can of food?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.84,0:16:04.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, don't go getting\Nthe wrong idea about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.94,0:16:08.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Just because I'm trying this\Ndoesn't mean I'm like them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.90,0:16:11.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm willing to give this a shot, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.68,0:16:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you insist on\Nmaking things difficult?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.78,0:16:17.38,Default,,0,0,0,,So what do you think\NSangoro has planned, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.46,0:16:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We're fighting an emperor of the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.38,0:16:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,There are going to be times\Nwhen we can't save a life,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.32,0:16:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,especially if we're too stubborn.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.36,0:16:30.01,Default,,0,0,0,,But if I swallow my pride, then there\Nare people I can save right here and now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.84,0:16:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm tired of hearing you kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.50,0:16:41.09,Default,,0,0,0,,If this has the power to help,\Nthen I clearly need to use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.24,0:16:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, here goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.24,0:17:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You really like wasting\Nmy time, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.20,0:17:16.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What's changing your\Nclothes supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.90,0:17:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Black leg.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.82,0:17:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.88,0:17:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,That costume!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.98,0:17:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Like a superhero! Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.28,0:17:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,So cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.44,0:17:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,How's that thing work?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.42,0:17:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold up. Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.86,0:17:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I recognize that outfit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.10,0:17:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That can't be right, can it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.54,0:17:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,That's from Sora, Warrior of the Sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.18,0:17:41.64,Default,,0,0,0,,He's wearing one of\Nthe villain's costumes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.72,0:17:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, it's all coming back to me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.66,0:17:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,that's the third member of the army\Nof evil Germa double six stealth black
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.54,0:17:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,how the hell do you know\Nso much about this everyone
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.54,0:18:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,knows their comics huge in the\Nnorth blue whatever i don't
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.86,0:18:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,care look don't ever call\Nme that again you got that i
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.14,0:18:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,know my stuff i was a I'm a\Nregular reader of the series.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.48,0:18:13.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I rooted for Sora to kick\NJerma's ass time after time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.92,0:18:15.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I hated him, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.48,0:18:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't ignore me! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.46,0:18:20.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever you got going\Non, it's fishy as hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.52,0:18:22.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Name yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.94,0:18:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I am...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.36,0:18:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Soba Mask!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.94,0:18:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,That name sucks and he's obviously Germa.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.82,0:18:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,oh come on man was that the best you got
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.18,0:18:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,why didn't you ask us for help bro are
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.96,0:18:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,you joking what kind of name is sober mask
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.90,0:19:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,but he was just here where did he go
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.56,0:19:05.39,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.58,0:19:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,How is he floating like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.58,0:19:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Check it out. Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.58,0:19:12.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew it when I saw it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.18,0:19:14.48,Default,,0,0,0,,No doubt about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.66,0:19:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Germatech.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.88,0:19:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,His shoes, especially.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.78,0:19:19.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It's how they hover around.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.02,0:19:21.37,Default,,0,0,0,,That's their trademark.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.84,0:19:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Show us what you can do!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.56,0:19:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I said you could beat\Nme by playing dress-up!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.68,0:19:34.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.59,0:19:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Ian, to a poor stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.51,0:19:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,He's failing to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.76,0:19:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.06,0:19:51.35,Default,,0,0,0,,He's failing to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.44,0:19:52.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he's failing to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.35,0:19:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,He's failing to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.06,0:19:54.89,Default,,0,0,0,,It's free to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.97,0:19:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't recognize anyone from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.89,0:19:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.80,0:19:57.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.88,0:19:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.90,0:20:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You really whooped him, Silvomask!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.20,0:20:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure like pissing me off, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.24,0:20:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,A little pest.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.26,0:20:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,How's this happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.72,0:20:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What the heck?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.22,0:20:36.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I think he's blocking his claws somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.70,0:20:39.47,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the power of\NJeremiah Double Six's cape.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.62,0:20:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It can form a rock-solid barrier.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.50,0:20:50.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That may have worked once,\Nbut I won't fall for it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.48,0:20:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That looks bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.64,0:20:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Stealth Black has a signature\Nmove for times like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.12,0:21:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,But can he do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.60,0:21:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,No more running!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.70,0:21:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,He vanished!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.18,0:21:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.36,0:21:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,People don't just disappear like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.34,0:21:15.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'd he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.66,0:21:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Show yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.86,0:21:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like he pulled it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.54,0:21:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't even see him!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.82,0:21:35.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he moving that fast?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.82,0:21:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Not quite.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.30,0:21:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Stealth Black's special ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.22,0:21:40.99,Default,,0,0,0,,He's able to become invisible.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.58,0:21:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,His suit projects an image of his\Nsurroundings over his entire body.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.02,0:21:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Even Sora, Warrior of the Sea,\Nhad a hard time with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.28,0:21:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Chairman really is the worst.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.38,0:22:00.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Just whose side are you on, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.72,0:22:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, Law, you sound like a nerd!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.48,0:22:06.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I said, everyone from\Nthe North Blue knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.36,0:22:15.83,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up with this suit?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.22,0:22:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Did I disappear?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.14,0:22:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It's almost like the clear clear fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.40,0:22:26.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever since I was little,\NI dreamed of becoming
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.76,0:22:31.40,Default,,0,0,0,,invisible this is the one\Nthis is the power i want
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.18,0:22:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,but i watched that wish\Ncrumble before my eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.64,0:22:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,you thief you took nami and\Nthen you stole my dream away
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.20,0:22:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,from me what the hell are you\Ntalking about we've never even
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.16,0:22:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,met before you messed up i've\Nalways wanted the skill of
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.12,0:22:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,invisibility But you had to find\Nthe clear clear fruit first.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.78,0:22:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You took its powers and you\Nstole my wish along with it
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.08,0:23:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What? That's why he's mad.\NI thought my dream was dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.66,0:23:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I come to find out it's possible\Nwith Germa technology of all things
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.06,0:23:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Irony's a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.48,0:23:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,This power will be quite useful
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.40,0:23:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Think how easy it'll be\Nto sneak into the ladies,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.56,0:23:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, how much I'll be able\Nto help out all of my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.56,0:23:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Boy, what a dilemma.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.56,0:23:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,An invisible superhero?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.44,0:23:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Something's going on here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.92,0:23:49.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not just some cook. Who\Nthe hell are you in this form?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.00,0:23:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll have a harder time hitting me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.68,0:23:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you can zip around fast who cares I
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.30,0:23:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Was planning to torture you nice and slow,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.54,0:24:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,but I suppose that I'd better\Nkill you quickly instead
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.90,0:24:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Jaggy, you awake?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.62,0:24:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Get up!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.70,0:24:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You got some extra dumplings for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.94,0:24:33.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll repay you, so hand over what you got!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.24,0:24:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're holding out on me, Jaggy!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.90,0:25:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,This room is ancient, quite curious.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.64,0:25:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,A land isolated for centuries.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.84,0:25:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,These are the people\Nwho created Poneglyph.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.20,0:25:15.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Surely there's one here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.86,0:25:20.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps there's a secret door somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.48,0:25:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you looking for something, madam?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.58,0:25:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't hear him at all. Who is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.40,0:25:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Go! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.64,0:25:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Go! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.28,0:25:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.44,0:25:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Show me what you can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.34,0:25:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,If that is what you desire, my lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.20,0:26:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Tama, let's make this a\Nfair and friendly fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.52,0:26:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You got it, Chobro Ramen! I'm ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.84,0:26:13.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Ninpaw!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.78,0:26:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Leaves Jutsu!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.04,0:26:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha! Ninpaw!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.90,0:26:20.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll dig-zag run!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.08,0:26:37.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never become a\Nbewitching ninja at this rate.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.22,0:26:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so pooped.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.22,0:26:41.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Job well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.44,0:26:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I had a hard time dodging it all
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.66,0:26:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Well done, you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.30,0:26:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I keep thinking about big bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.24,0:26:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I sure hope he's okay
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.94,0:26:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.48,0:26:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy will always come out on top
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.20,0:27:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,However, Ryza's correspondence\Nis alarmingly tardy.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.30,0:27:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a bit concerned My master told\Nme something that worried me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.40,0:27:10.64,Default,,0,0,0,,He said no one's ever come\Nback from the prison in Udon
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.88,0:27:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Trust me, he'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.40,0:27:14.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Neem, neem.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.36,0:27:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Focus on improving yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.52,0:27:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all we can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.24,0:27:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Neem pose, tree climbing jiu-jitsu.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.74,0:27:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Neem, neem, neem.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.12,0:27:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish I were strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.56,0:27:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I would simply retrieve\Nhim myself right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.88,0:27:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Neem, neem, neem.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.06,0:27:29.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.74,0:27:34.15,Default,,0,0,0,,There's something washed up on the beach.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.84,0:27:35.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.56,0:27:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Neem, neem.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.30,0:27:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,She's so skilled.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.84,0:27:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,So I wonder what the story\Nis behind that mask of hers.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.62,0:27:50.39,Default,,0,0,0,,She wears it every time\Nshe plays the shamisen.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.86,0:27:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, yes, that's the stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.98,0:27:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Now this is beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.84,0:27:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.22,0:28:03.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.58,0:28:06.93,Default,,0,0,0,,We have you surrounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.36,0:28:10.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You should consider your actions\Nin the presence of ninja.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.98,0:28:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,How bold.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.44,0:28:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's possible that she's\Nnever heard of ninjas before.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.70,0:28:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,She could be a foreigner.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.04,0:28:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Good evening, Miss Geisha.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.82,0:28:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, getting into trouble, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.10,0:28:44.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall hear your explanation.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.64,0:28:48.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Speak carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.02,0:28:50.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You have only one chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.36,0:29:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,This won't be easy after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.98,0:29:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Ancient Zoans are pretty tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.46,0:29:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,However, it's going to take more\Nthan that to defeat Stealth Black.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.62,0:29:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,That stung a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.38,0:29:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,But this suit's pretty durable.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.56,0:29:43.33,Default,,0,0,0,,The capital is going to\Nfall apart before I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.10,0:29:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go back!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.40,0:29:50.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are we leaving Sangoro behind?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.60,0:29:52.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Because he gave us the okay to move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.14,0:29:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but he was just being cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.92,0:30:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to wrap this up and bring\Nhis lifeless body to Kyoshiro.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.96,0:30:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, I wonder who he really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.74,0:30:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,that's going to attract more\Nattention and likely more enemies too
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.14,0:30:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,let's head to Ebisu town better\Nstay out of the capital a while
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.16,0:30:42.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.28,0:30:47.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.82,0:30:50.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.90,0:30:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Shooting star!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.04,0:30:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Soma King!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.10,0:31:01.93,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.66,0:31:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.82,0:31:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Nearly left to scratch.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.42,0:31:28.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.20,0:31:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop hiding!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.58,0:31:32.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Super Mask!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.49,0:31:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Reveal yourself now!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.32,0:31:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess I could get used to this name.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.26,0:31:42.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll have to ask for Nosuke and\NUsahachi for a redesign, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.06,0:31:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It's this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.28,0:31:50.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think it is, Chobro?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.56,0:31:54.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that a person?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.46,0:31:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,They're colossal, if so.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.96,0:32:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,But not quite giant size.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.70,0:32:06.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, it looks like they might\Neven be bigger than Kaido.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.34,0:32:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that a woman?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.28,0:32:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,My goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.86,0:32:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.44,0:32:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What the heck's being mu -
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.24,0:32:37.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.72,0:32:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Psh!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.63,0:32:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep it down or else\Nyou'll wake her up! Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.10,0:32:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,,If she sees us, we're done for!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.48,0:32:45.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.39,0:32:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,No, forget it!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.48,0:32:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if we did run, she'd chase\Nus all the way to hell and back!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.28,0:32:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, I don't understand!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.72,0:32:55.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you mean to say you\Nknow who this woman is?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.74,0:32:56.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.65,0:32:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone knows her!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.10,0:33:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The infamous Big Mom lies before me?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.92,0:33:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Lower your voice!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.40,0:33:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,So, who is Big Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.48,0:33:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll explain everything later.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.64,0:33:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't hold back.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.66,0:33:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I must kill her right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.76,0:33:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I know she's asleep, but\Nthink of her as a Kaido.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.74,0:33:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,She's just as dangerous as him.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.02,0:33:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all over!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.86,0:33:37.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.86,0:33:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.26,0:33:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.26,0:34:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.58,0:34:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Who am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.10,0:34:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.26,0:34:23.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
